Package: tind-branding
Version: 0.1.16
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: gnome-shell, dconf-cli, papirus-icon-theme, fontconfig
Recommends: plymouth, plymouth-themes, gnome-shell-extension-dashtodock
Installed-Size: 5264
Description: Tind visual identity: logo, wallpapers, ice shell styling, boot splash
 Tind's identity as installable files: os-release, logo icons, light and dark
 wallpapers, the Tind Ice GNOME Shell styling (night and midday), GNOME defaults (dark by default,
 teal accent, Papirus icons, Nunito Sans font), the Tind logo as the dock Show Apps button, the Plymouth
 boot splash and the GRUB theme.
 .
 os-release is replaced via dpkg-divert so it survives base-files upgrades.
